<title>UK: GRANDMET TO UPDATE ON PILLSBURY TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>GRANDMET TO UPDATE ON PILLSBURY TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Grand Metropolitan Plc plans to give analysts and institutional investors an update on business performance at Pillsbury, its U.S. foods business, on Tuesday, said a company spokesman.</p>
<p>&quot;It will cover brand development and a general update on Pillsbury,&quot; said the spokesman.</p>
<p>GrandMet chairman George Bull and Pillsbury chief executive Paul Walsh will give the presentation to be held at 1000 GMT, at SBC Warburg in London.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6437  </p>
